# app3d/WalkerRender — the walker app shell's renderer state and passes
# (app3d/WalkerApp): the physics cubes, the shadow pass, the GPU grass and the
# scene's draws, which the deferred frame makes into its G-buffer pass and the
# forward frame into its forward pass (and its SSAO pre-pass). The graph walk
# that calls them is app3d/WalkerRenderWalk.
